  "lines": [
    {
      "actorId": "june",
      "speaker": "琼",
      "text": "刚结束西边桥面的抢修。路口的新牌子只有一个钉孔，旧牌子有四个。慢一点没关系，我的手冻得拿不稳硬币。",
      "profile": "N25",
      "clipId": "n25-42939004d6a2",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/n25-42939004d6a2.wav",
      "seconds": 10.7332
    },
    {
      "actorId": "june",
      "speaker": "琼",
      "text": "西桥维修通道。雾太大，我沿路边灯过来。",
      "profile": "N25",
      "clipId": "n25-c12c0784d8d0",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/n25-c12c0784d8d0.wav",
      "seconds": 4.2874
    },
    {
      "actorId": "june",
      "speaker": "琼",
      "text": "现在是 Ruth 调度的新养护队。旧班组的 Mike 三年前就去世了，你可以查事故记录。",
      "profile": "N25",
      "clipId": "n25-231fba0d8faf",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/n25-231fba0d8faf.wav",
      "seconds": 7.916
    },
    {
      "actorId": "june",
      "speaker": "琼",
      "text": "以前的夜班员？他总把找零硬币按年份分开。后来再没见过。",
      "profile": "N25",
      "clipId": "n25-d716c0af080b",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/n25-d716c0af080b.wav",
      "seconds": 6.1465
    },
    {
      "actorId": "june",
      "speaker": "琼",
      "text": "我还在挑东西。有什么事吗？",
      "profile": "N25",
      "clipId": "n25-cb6b2b44d375",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/n25-cb6b2b44d375.wav",
      "seconds": 2.7477
    },
    {
      "actorId": "june",
      "speaker": "琼",
      "text": "这些就是我挑的商品。麻烦你了。",
      "profile": "N25",
      "clipId": "n25-117307c80446",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/n25-117307c80446.wav",
      "seconds": 3.1001
    },
    {
      "actorId": "june",
      "speaker": "琼",
      "text": "谢谢，路上小心。",
      "profile": "N25",
      "clipId": "n25-8a45852189e3",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/n25-8a45852189e3.wav",
      "seconds": 1.7388
    },
    {
      "actorId": "june",
      "speaker": "琼",
      "text": "好吧，我去下一个站。",
      "profile": "N25",
      "clipId": "n25-3fc93796a117",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/n25-3fc93796a117.wav",
      "seconds": 2.009
    },
    {
      "actorId": "june",
      "speaker": "琼",
      "text": "这张多了，我退给你。再算一下剩余的。",
      "profile": "N25",
      "clipId": "n25-842e7be60d3c",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/n25-842e7be60d3c.wav",
      "seconds": 3.8551
    },
    {
      "actorId": "june",
      "speaker": "琼",
      "text": "这不够吧？麻烦再算一下。",
      "profile": "N25",
      "clipId": "n25-6ae7fbd636ba",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/n25-6ae7fbd636ba.wav",
      "seconds": 2.6755
    },
    {
      "actorId": "june",
      "speaker": "琼",
      "text": "你多找了。不是这个数。",
      "profile": "N25",
      "clipId": "n25-b89af97da100",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/n25-b89af97da100.wav",
      "seconds": 2.244
    },
    {
      "actorId": "wade",
      "speaker": "韦德",
      "text": "门口的路我走不惯。别担心，资料都是真的。你可以查。",
      "profile": "N22",
      "clipId": "n22-d2b67ed9c7c4",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/n22-d2b67ed9c7c4.wav",
      "seconds": 5.7218
    },
    {
      "actorId": "wade",
      "speaker": "韦德",
      "text": "后门外。别看前面的车，那不是我开的。",
      "profile": "N22",
      "clipId": "n22-4ab3307265ce",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/n22-4ab3307265ce.wav",
      "seconds": 3.9498
    },
    {
      "actorId": "wade",
      "speaker": "韦德",
      "text": "一直开着。里面不需要开灯，东西也不会坏。",
      "profile": "N22",
      "clipId": "n22-113d03bdbc9f",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/n22-113d03bdbc9f.wav",
      "seconds": 4.2807
    },
    {
      "actorId": "wade",
      "speaker": "韦德",
      "text": "我每天经过。你们每次都换一个出口编号。",
      "profile": "N22",
      "clipId": "n22-03742baa9ac1",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/n22-03742baa9ac1.wav",
      "seconds": 4.2315
    },
    {
      "actorId": "wade",
      "speaker": "韦德",
      "text": "我还在挑东西。有什么事吗？",
      "profile": "N22",
      "clipId": "n22-cb6b2b44d375",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/n22-cb6b2b44d375.wav",
      "seconds": 2.748
    },
    {
      "actorId": "wade",
      "speaker": "韦德",
      "text": "这些就是我挑的商品。麻烦你了。",
      "profile": "N22",
      "clipId": "n22-117307c80446",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/n22-117307c80446.wav",
      "seconds": 3.1032
    },
    {
      "actorId": "wade",
      "speaker": "韦德",
      "text": "我们明晚还会见面。",
      "profile": "N22",
      "clipId": "n22-35e821329aa8",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/n22-35e821329aa8.wav",
      "seconds": 1.7452
    },
    {
      "actorId": "wade",
      "speaker": "韦德",
      "text": "你还会需要我的。",
      "profile": "N22",
      "clipId": "n22-2b81462e4ec4",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/n22-2b81462e4ec4.wav",
      "seconds": 1.4357
    },
    {
      "actorId": "wade",
      "speaker": "韦德",
      "text": "这张多了，我退给你。再算一下剩余的。",
      "profile": "N22",
      "clipId": "n22-842e7be60d3c",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/n22-842e7be60d3c.wav",
      "seconds": 3.8585
    },
    {
      "actorId": "wade",
      "speaker": "韦德",
      "text": "这不够吧？麻烦再算一下。",
      "profile": "N22",
      "clipId": "n22-6ae7fbd636ba",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/n22-6ae7fbd636ba.wav",
      "seconds": 2.6751
    },
    {
      "actorId": "wade",
      "speaker": "韦德",
      "text": "你多找了。不是这个数。",
      "profile": "N22",
      "clipId": "n22-b89af97da100",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/n22-b89af97da100.wav",
      "seconds": 2.2603
    },
    {
      "actorId": "edith",
      "speaker": "伊迪丝",
      "text": "旧出口没改号以前，我每周都送孩子经过。Daniel 帮我换过一次轮胎。他从不穿左边口袋破了的那件外套。",
      "profile": "N26",
      "clipId": "n26-8f46de9146bf",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/n26-8f46de9146bf.wav",
      "seconds": 9.5447
    },
    {
      "actorId": "edith",
      "speaker": "伊迪丝",
      "text": "新路的灯太亮，反而认不出以前的路口。",
      "profile": "N26",
      "clipId": "n26-c620688ba43f",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/n26-c620688ba43f.wav",
      "seconds": 3.5605
    },
    {
      "actorId": "edith",
      "speaker": "伊迪丝",
      "text": "左口袋缝着蓝线，是我帮他缝的。",
      "profile": "N26",
      "clipId": "n26-17780a5b03bf",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/n26-17780a5b03bf.wav",
      "seconds": 3.0164
    },
    {
      "actorId": "edith",
      "speaker": "伊迪丝",
      "text": "没人。车里的收音机却一路有人叫我的名字。",
      "profile": "N26",
      "clipId": "n26-216cb5ac97c0",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/n26-216cb5ac97c0.wav",
      "seconds": 3.8688
    },
    {
      "actorId": "edith",
      "speaker": "伊迪丝",
      "text": "我还在挑东西。有什么事吗？",
      "profile": "N26",
      "clipId": "n26-cb6b2b44d375",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/n26-cb6b2b44d375.wav",
      "seconds": 2.6513
    },
    {
      "actorId": "edith",
      "speaker": "伊迪丝",
      "text": "这些就是我挑的商品。麻烦你了。",
      "profile": "N26",
      "clipId": "n26-117307c80446",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/n26-117307c80446.wav",
      "seconds": 2.9853
    },
    {
      "actorId": "edith",
      "speaker": "伊迪丝",
      "text": "谢谢，路上小心。",
      "profile": "N26",
      "clipId": "n26-8a45852189e3",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/n26-8a45852189e3.wav",
      "seconds": 1.6937
    },
    {
      "actorId": "edith",
      "speaker": "伊迪丝",
      "text": "好吧，我去下一个站。",
      "profile": "N26",
      "clipId": "n26-3fc93796a117",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/n26-3fc93796a117.wav",
      "seconds": 1.9457
    },
    {
      "actorId": "edith",
      "speaker": "伊迪丝",
      "text": "这张多了，我退给你。再算一下剩余的。",
      "profile": "N26",
      "clipId": "n26-842e7be60d3c",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/n26-842e7be60d3c.wav",
      "seconds": 3.7104
    },
    {
      "actorId": "edith",
      "speaker": "伊迪丝",
      "text": "这不够吧？麻烦再算一下。",
      "profile": "N26",
      "clipId": "n26-6ae7fbd636ba",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/n26-6ae7fbd636ba.wav",
      "seconds": 2.5751
    },
    {
      "actorId": "edith",
      "speaker": "伊迪丝",
      "text": "你多找了。不是这个数。",
      "profile": "N26",
      "clipId": "n26-b89af97da100",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/n26-b89af97da100.wav",
      "seconds": 2.1657
    },
    {
      "actorId": "nora",
      "speaker": "诺拉",
      "text": "别只看照片，地址和编号还能读。医院的出勤记录也能查到我。今晚有个病人一直问九号出口，我们的旧地图里没有它。",
      "profile": "N24",
      "clipId": "n24-0583654a75b6",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/n24-0583654a75b6.wav",
      "seconds": 10.9665
    },
    {
      "actorId": "nora",
      "speaker": "诺拉",
      "text": "县医院东楼。我的换证申请也在那里盖过章。",
      "profile": "N24",
      "clipId": "n24-9d2debce03fe",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/n24-9d2debce03fe.wav",
      "seconds": 4.2674
    },
    {
      "actorId": "nora",
      "speaker": "诺拉",
      "text": "只有我。路上看见一辆没有开近光的配送车。",
      "profile": "N24",
      "clipId": "n24-3a8637723c7a",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/n24-3a8637723c7a.wav",
      "seconds": 4.2572
    },
    {
      "actorId": "nora",
      "speaker": "诺拉",
      "text": "病人说在那里等哥哥。但他的病例记载，他没有兄弟姐妹。",
      "profile": "N24",
      "clipId": "n24-ee7b13d8c870",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/n24-ee7b13d8c870.wav",
      "seconds": 5.0487
    },
    {
      "actorId": "nora",
      "speaker": "诺拉",
      "text": "我还在挑东西。有什么事吗？",
      "profile": "N24",
      "clipId": "n24-cb6b2b44d375",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/n24-cb6b2b44d375.wav",
      "seconds": 2.6481
    },
    {
      "actorId": "nora",
      "speaker": "诺拉",
      "text": "这些就是我挑的商品。麻烦你了。",
      "profile": "N24",
      "clipId": "n24-117307c80446",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/n24-117307c80446.wav",
      "seconds": 2.9851
    },
    {
      "actorId": "nora",
      "speaker": "诺拉",
      "text": "谢谢，路上小心。",
      "profile": "N24",
      "clipId": "n24-8a45852189e3",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/n24-8a45852189e3.wav",
      "seconds": 1.6937
    },
    {
      "actorId": "nora",
      "speaker": "诺拉",
      "text": "好吧，我去下一个站。",
      "profile": "N24",
      "clipId": "n24-3fc93796a117",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/n24-3fc93796a117.wav",
      "seconds": 1.9415
    },
    {
      "actorId": "nora",
      "speaker": "诺拉",
      "text": "这张多了，我退给你。再算一下剩余的。",
      "profile": "N24",
      "clipId": "n24-842e7be60d3c",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/n24-842e7be60d3c.wav",
      "seconds": 3.7114
    },
    {
      "actorId": "nora",
      "speaker": "诺拉",
      "text": "这不够吧？麻烦再算一下。",
      "profile": "N24",
      "clipId": "n24-6ae7fbd636ba",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/n24-6ae7fbd636ba.wav",
      "seconds": 2.5725
    },
    {
      "actorId": "nora",
      "speaker": "诺拉",
      "text": "你多找了。不是这个数。",
      "profile": "N24",
      "clipId": "n24-b89af97da100",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/n24-b89af97da100.wav",
      "seconds": 2.1655
    },
    {
      "actorId": "owen",
      "speaker": "欧文",
      "text": "在北面的广告牌下，有个人一直面向树林。我回头时他已经在广告牌另一边了，没听见脚步。",
      "profile": "N23",
      "clipId": "n23-f69262cecb62",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/n23-f69262cecb62.wav",
      "seconds": 8.2784
    },
    {
      "actorId": "owen",
      "speaker": "欧文",
      "text": "HALF A MILE。一眼是这个，再看又像 LAST MILE。",
      "profile": "N23",
      "clipId": "n23-18e39d5da065",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/n23-18e39d5da065.wav",
      "seconds": 4.0676
    },
    {
      "actorId": "owen",
      "speaker": "欧文",
      "text": "我只看见车灯，驾驶室里没有亮过灯。",
      "profile": "N23",
      "clipId": "n23-72b61bc8615e",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/n23-72b61bc8615e.wav",
      "seconds": 3.2389
    },
    {
      "actorId": "owen",
      "speaker": "欧文",
      "text": "昨天经过，店里那块公告板还没有失踪广告。",
      "profile": "N23",
      "clipId": "n23-b1291908fc88",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/n23-b1291908fc88.wav",
      "seconds": 4.041
    },
    {
      "actorId": "owen",
      "speaker": "欧文",
      "text": "我还在挑东西。有什么事吗？",
      "profile": "N23",
      "clipId": "n23-cb6b2b44d375",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/n23-cb6b2b44d375.wav",
      "seconds": 2.6525
    },
    {
      "actorId": "owen",
      "speaker": "欧文",
      "text": "这些就是我挑的商品。麻烦你了。",
      "profile": "N23",
      "clipId": "n23-117307c80446",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/n23-117307c80446.wav",
      "seconds": 2.9912
    },
    {
      "actorId": "owen",
      "speaker": "欧文",
      "text": "谢谢，路上小心。",
      "profile": "N23",
      "clipId": "n23-8a45852189e3",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/n23-8a45852189e3.wav",
      "seconds": 1.6792
    },
    {
      "actorId": "owen",
      "speaker": "欧文",
      "text": "好吧，我去下一个站。",
      "profile": "N23",
      "clipId": "n23-3fc93796a117",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/n23-3fc93796a117.wav",
      "seconds": 1.9473
    },
    {
      "actorId": "owen",
      "speaker": "欧文",
      "text": "这张多了，我退给你。再算一下剩余的。",
      "profile": "N23",
      "clipId": "n23-842e7be60d3c",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/n23-842e7be60d3c.wav",
      "seconds": 3.7156
    },
    {
      "actorId": "owen",
      "speaker": "欧文",
