      "text": "你多找了。不是这个数。",
      "profile": "N23",
      "clipId": "n23-b89af97da100",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/n23-b89af97da100.wav",
      "seconds": 2.1797
    },
    {
      "actorId": "rowan",
      "speaker": "罗文",
      "text": "我知道你今晚一个人。电话坏了也没关系，让我进去就是了。",
      "profile": "N21",
      "clipId": "n21-91ad6290fcc9",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/n21-91ad6290fcc9.wav",
      "seconds": 5.2385
    },
    {
      "actorId": "rowan",
      "speaker": "罗文",
      "text": "老板。我们刚通完电话，你不会连他的声音都听不出来吧。",
      "profile": "N21",
      "clipId": "n21-543ba1d36326",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/n21-543ba1d36326.wav",
      "seconds": 5.6465
    },
    {
      "actorId": "rowan",
      "speaker": "罗文",
      "text": "EMP-091。资料是真的，你尽管拿去查。",
      "profile": "N21",
      "clipId": "n21-6602c61170ce",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/n21-6602c61170ce.wav",
      "seconds": 4.2945
    },
    {
      "actorId": "rowan",
      "speaker": "罗文",
      "text": "他还在交班。只要你开门，他就不用继续等了。",
      "profile": "N21",
      "clipId": "n21-b10ac7836625",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/n21-b10ac7836625.wav",
      "seconds": 4.3238
    },
    {
      "actorId": "rowan",
      "speaker": "罗文",
      "text": "老板让我来帮你卸货。把后门打开，我替你搬剩下的。",
      "profile": "N21",
      "clipId": "n21-d486aedb951e",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/n21-d486aedb951e.wav",
      "seconds": 4.9954
    },
    {
      "actorId": "rowan",
      "speaker": "罗文",
      "text": "我们明晚还会见面。",
      "profile": "N21",
      "clipId": "n21-35e821329aa8",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/n21-35e821329aa8.wav",
      "seconds": 1.6654
    },
    {
      "actorId": "rowan",
      "speaker": "罗文",
      "text": "你还会需要我的。",
      "profile": "N21",
      "clipId": "n21-2b81462e4ec4",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/n21-2b81462e4ec4.wav",
      "seconds": 1.3827
    },
    {
      "actorId": "rowan",
      "speaker": "罗文",
      "text": "这张多了，我退给你。再算一下剩余的。",
      "profile": "N21",
      "clipId": "n21-842e7be60d3c",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/n21-842e7be60d3c.wav",
      "seconds": 3.7187
    },
    {
      "actorId": "rowan",
      "speaker": "罗文",
      "text": "这不够吧？麻烦再算一下。",
      "profile": "N21",
      "clipId": "n21-6ae7fbd636ba",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/n21-6ae7fbd636ba.wav",
      "seconds": 2.577
    },
    {
      "actorId": "rowan",
      "speaker": "罗文",
      "text": "你多找了。不是这个数。",
      "profile": "N21",
      "clipId": "n21-b89af97da100",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/n21-b89af97da100.wav",
      "seconds": 2.1806
    },
    {
      "actorId": "leon",
      "speaker": "里昂",
      "text": "我没再按第二次付款。订单应该还是待处理，尾号 2305。",
      "profile": "N21",
      "clipId": "n21-33f5f4aac667",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/n21-33f5f4aac667.wav",
      "seconds": 5.8621
    },
    {
      "actorId": "leon",
      "speaker": "里昂",
      "text": "没有，只付了一次，尾号 2305，卡也是这张。",
      "profile": "N21",
      "clipId": "n21-dcf25e107b20",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/n21-dcf25e107b20.wav",
      "seconds": 4.7503
    },
    {
      "actorId": "leon",
      "speaker": "里昂",
      "text": "车尾站着个员工，帽檐很低。我按喇叭时他没转身。",
      "profile": "N21",
      "clipId": "n21-dad40cacf25c",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/n21-dad40cacf25c.wav",
      "seconds": 4.8388
    },
    {
      "actorId": "leon",
      "speaker": "里昂",
      "text": "旧支线关闭三周年。报道上那张便利店照片，招牌是八。",
      "profile": "N21",
      "clipId": "n21-16f343cf423a",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/n21-16f343cf423a.wav",
      "seconds": 5.3653
    },
    {
      "actorId": "leon",
      "speaker": "里昂",
      "text": "三号泵吞了我的钱，但一滴油也没出。能帮我查一下吗？",
      "profile": "N21",
      "clipId": "n21-c7de8ea1a39f",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/n21-c7de8ea1a39f.wav",
      "seconds": 5.1937
    },
    {
      "actorId": "leon",
      "speaker": "里昂",
      "text": "谢谢，路上小心。",
      "profile": "N21",
      "clipId": "n21-8a45852189e3",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/n21-8a45852189e3.wav",
      "seconds": 1.693
    },
    {
      "actorId": "leon",
      "speaker": "里昂",
      "text": "好吧，我去下一个站。",
      "profile": "N21",
      "clipId": "n21-3fc93796a117",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/n21-3fc93796a117.wav",
      "seconds": 1.9524
    },
    {
      "actorId": "leon",
      "speaker": "里昂",
      "text": "这张多了，我退给你。再算一下剩余的。",
      "profile": "N21",
      "clipId": "n21-842e7be60d3c",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/n21-842e7be60d3c.wav",
      "seconds": 3.7187
    },
    {
      "actorId": "leon",
      "speaker": "里昂",
      "text": "这不够吧？麻烦再算一下。",
      "profile": "N21",
      "clipId": "n21-6ae7fbd636ba",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/n21-6ae7fbd636ba.wav",
      "seconds": 2.577
    },
    {
      "actorId": "leon",
      "speaker": "里昂",
      "text": "你多找了。不是这个数。",
      "profile": "N21",
      "clipId": "n21-b89af97da100",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/n21-b89af97da100.wav",
      "seconds": 2.1806
    },
    {
      "actorId": "milo",
      "speaker": "迈洛",
      "text": "你还没有报修？那是我来早了。先让我看一眼，别把门关上。",
      "profile": "N23",
      "clipId": "n23-efea9750bfe4",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/n23-efea9750bfe4.wav",
      "seconds": 5.7703
    },
    {
      "actorId": "milo",
      "speaker": "迈洛",
      "text": "调度员。她说你会需要我，时间不会错。",
      "profile": "N23",
      "clipId": "n23-efe3d2683616",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/n23-efe3d2683616.wav",
      "seconds": 3.9455
    },
    {
      "actorId": "milo",
      "speaker": "迈洛",
      "text": "无线电。它不该收得到已经停用的频道。",
      "profile": "N23",
      "clipId": "n23-fa8a6f30a98a",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/n23-fa8a6f30a98a.wav",
      "seconds": 3.753
    },
    {
      "actorId": "milo",
      "speaker": "迈洛",
      "text": "这是你的第三晚？你上次也是这样问我。",
      "profile": "N23",
      "clipId": "n23-406adc84dc18",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/n23-406adc84dc18.wav",
      "seconds": 3.4065
    },
    {
      "actorId": "milo",
      "speaker": "迈洛",
      "text": "我还在挑东西。有什么事吗？",
      "profile": "N23",
      "clipId": "n23-cb6b2b44d375",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/n23-cb6b2b44d375.wav",
      "seconds": 2.6525
    },
    {
      "actorId": "milo",
      "speaker": "迈洛",
      "text": "这些就是我挑的商品。麻烦你了。",
      "profile": "N23",
      "clipId": "n23-117307c80446",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/n23-117307c80446.wav",
      "seconds": 2.9912
    },
    {
      "actorId": "milo",
      "speaker": "迈洛",
      "text": "我们明晚还会见面。",
      "profile": "N23",
      "clipId": "n23-35e821329aa8",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/n23-35e821329aa8.wav",
      "seconds": 1.6717
    },
    {
      "actorId": "milo",
      "speaker": "迈洛",
      "text": "你还会需要我的。",
      "profile": "N23",
      "clipId": "n23-2b81462e4ec4",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/n23-2b81462e4ec4.wav",
      "seconds": 1.3834
    },
    {
      "actorId": "milo",
      "speaker": "迈洛",
      "text": "这张多了，我退给你。再算一下剩余的。",
