      "clipId": "n23-b89af97da100",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/n23-b89af97da100.wav",
      "seconds": 2.1797
    },
    {
      "actorId": "nora",
      "speaker": "诺拉",
      "text": "我把旧报纸带来了。失踪的 Daniel 和你同姓。你昨晚的记录已经送到医院保安那里了。",
      "profile": "N24",
      "clipId": "n24-64261484bd08",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/n24-64261484bd08.wav",
      "seconds": 7.2042
    },
    {
      "actorId": "nora",
      "speaker": "诺拉",
      "text": "病人的探视人签名是 Daniel Reed，可录像里探视室一直空着。",
      "profile": "N24",
      "clipId": "n24-dda06139d7c3",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/n24-dda06139d7c3.wav",
      "seconds": 4.8758
    },
    {
      "actorId": "ruth",
      "speaker": "露丝",
      "text": "我在另一端接过你的电话。你还没说站点名字，线路里就有人先说了第九出口。",
      "profile": "N25",
      "clipId": "n25-def75dbd95df",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/n25-def75dbd95df.wav",
      "seconds": 7.4515
    },
    {
      "actorId": "ruth",
      "speaker": "露丝",
      "text": "一通只有呼吸声。另一通是你在读一张还没打印的小票。",
      "profile": "N25",
      "clipId": "n25-b61a3ec7f36d",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/n25-b61a3ec7f36d.wav",
      "seconds": 5.1585
    },
    {
      "actorId": "ruth",
      "speaker": "露丝",
      "text": "这个号码停用了。先别打回去，保留你手里的记录。",
      "profile": "N25",
      "clipId": "n25-de18bcb7d414",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/n25-de18bcb7d414.wav",
      "seconds": 4.7353
    },
    {
      "actorId": "ruth",
      "speaker": "露丝",
      "text": "看今夜的轮值编号。证件是真的，也不能替我决定是否能进后仓。",
      "profile": "N25",
      "clipId": "n25-98bb3e118762",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/n25-98bb3e118762.wav",
      "seconds": 6.2063
    },
    {
      "actorId": "ruth",
      "speaker": "露丝",
      "text": "我还在挑东西。有什么事吗？",
      "profile": "N25",
      "clipId": "n25-cb6b2b44d375",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/n25-cb6b2b44d375.wav",
      "seconds": 2.7477
    },
    {
      "actorId": "ruth",
      "speaker": "露丝",
      "text": "这些就是我挑的商品。麻烦你了。",
      "profile": "N25",
      "clipId": "n25-117307c80446",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/n25-117307c80446.wav",
      "seconds": 3.1001
    },
    {
      "actorId": "ruth",
      "speaker": "露丝",
      "text": "谢谢，路上小心。",
      "profile": "N25",
      "clipId": "n25-8a45852189e3",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/n25-8a45852189e3.wav",
      "seconds": 1.7388
    },
    {
      "actorId": "ruth",
      "speaker": "露丝",
      "text": "好吧，我去下一个站。",
      "profile": "N25",
      "clipId": "n25-3fc93796a117",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/n25-3fc93796a117.wav",
      "seconds": 2.009
    },
    {
      "actorId": "ruth",
      "speaker": "露丝",
      "text": "这张多了，我退给你。再算一下剩余的。",
      "profile": "N25",
      "clipId": "n25-842e7be60d3c",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/n25-842e7be60d3c.wav",
      "seconds": 3.8551
    },
    {
      "actorId": "ruth",
      "speaker": "露丝",
      "text": "这不够吧？麻烦再算一下。",
      "profile": "N25",
      "clipId": "n25-6ae7fbd636ba",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/n25-6ae7fbd636ba.wav",
      "seconds": 2.6755
    },
    {
      "actorId": "ruth",
      "speaker": "露丝",
      "text": "你多找了。不是这个数。",
      "profile": "N25",
      "clipId": "n25-b89af97da100",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/n25-b89af97da100.wav",
      "seconds": 2.244
    },
    {
      "actorId": "june",
      "speaker": "琼",
      "text": "西桥还在施工，Mike 还在等我。昨天？昨天我没有来过这里。",
      "profile": "N25",
      "clipId": "n25-987ea0b4b1ca",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/n25-987ea0b4b1ca.wav",
      "seconds": 6.1443
    },
    {
      "actorId": "june",
      "speaker": "琼",
      "text": "西桥维修通道。我每天都走，三年前也走。",
      "profile": "N25",
      "clipId": "n25-58f3c1b8b1b2",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/n25-58f3c1b8b1b2.wav",
      "seconds": 4.6485
    },
    {
      "actorId": "june",
      "speaker": "琼",
      "text": "Mike 还在桥上。他没有死。",
      "profile": "N25",
      "clipId": "n25-36b81c1143d6",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/n25-36b81c1143d6.wav",
      "seconds": 2.777
    },
    {
      "actorId": "june",
      "speaker": "琼",
      "text": "我们明晚还会见面。",
      "profile": "N25",
      "clipId": "n25-35e821329aa8",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/n25-35e821329aa8.wav",
      "seconds": 1.7265
    },
    {
      "actorId": "june",
      "speaker": "琼",
      "text": "你还会需要我的。",
      "profile": "N25",
      "clipId": "n25-2b81462e4ec4",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/n25-2b81462e4ec4.wav",
      "seconds": 1.4189
    },
    {
      "actorId": "rowan",
      "speaker": "罗文",
      "text": "Daniel 让我来接班。你已经拿到他的员工卡了，不是吗？开门，我拿回去。",
      "profile": "N21",
      "clipId": "n21-c633853adaad",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/n21-c633853adaad.wav",
      "seconds": 6.6225
    },
    {
      "actorId": "cal",
      "speaker": "卡尔",
      "text": "上面还有一间员工室，门没关。我在窗户外看见你了。",
      "profile": "N22",
      "clipId": "n22-18ffc688ebf7",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/n22-18ffc688ebf7.wav",
      "seconds": 5.3059
    },
    {
      "actorId": "cal",
      "speaker": "卡尔",
      "text": "你。十分钟前，或者明天十分钟前。",
      "profile": "N22",
      "clipId": "n22-010b10cefedf",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/n22-010b10cefedf.wav",
      "seconds": 3.9456
    },
    {
      "actorId": "cal",
      "speaker": "卡尔",
      "text": "上面。你刚才在那里看着我。",
      "profile": "N22",
      "clipId": "n22-3638dc565843",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/n22-3638dc565843.wav",
      "seconds": 2.8328
    },
    {
      "actorId": "cal",
      "speaker": "卡尔",
      "text": "我负责拆掉它。每次都只剩一个员工不肯离开。",
      "profile": "N22",
      "clipId": "n22-20c280c96525",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/n22-20c280c96525.wav",
      "seconds": 4.6404
    },
    {
      "actorId": "cal",
      "speaker": "卡尔",
      "text": "我还在挑东西。有什么事吗？",
      "profile": "N22",
      "clipId": "n22-cb6b2b44d375",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/n22-cb6b2b44d375.wav",
      "seconds": 2.748
    },
    {
      "actorId": "cal",
      "speaker": "卡尔",
      "text": "这些就是我挑的商品。麻烦你了。",
      "profile": "N22",
      "clipId": "n22-117307c80446",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/n22-117307c80446.wav",
      "seconds": 3.1032
    },
    {
      "actorId": "cal",
      "speaker": "卡尔",
      "text": "我们明晚还会见面。",
      "profile": "N22",
      "clipId": "n22-35e821329aa8",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/n22-35e821329aa8.wav",
      "seconds": 1.7452
    },
    {
      "actorId": "cal",
      "speaker": "卡尔",
      "text": "你还会需要我的。",
      "profile": "N22",
      "clipId": "n22-2b81462e4ec4",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/n22-2b81462e4ec4.wav",
      "seconds": 1.4357
    },
    {
      "actorId": "cal",
      "speaker": "卡尔",
      "text": "这张多了，我退给你。再算一下剩余的。",
      "profile": "N22",
      "clipId": "n22-842e7be60d3c",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/n22-842e7be60d3c.wav",
      "seconds": 3.8585
    },
    {
      "actorId": "cal",
      "speaker": "卡尔",
      "text": "这不够吧？麻烦再算一下。",
      "profile": "N22",
      "clipId": "n22-6ae7fbd636ba",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/n22-6ae7fbd636ba.wav",
      "seconds": 2.6751
    },
    {
      "actorId": "cal",
      "speaker": "卡尔",
      "text": "你多找了。不是这个数。",
      "profile": "N22",
      "clipId": "n22-b89af97da100",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/n22-b89af97da100.wav",
      "seconds": 2.2603
    },
    {
      "actorId": "wade",
      "speaker": "韦德",
      "text": "还是后面。你的门昨天没有开，今天总该开了。",
      "profile": "N22",
      "clipId": "n22-5876dfd21306",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/n22-5876dfd21306.wav",
      "seconds": 4.7259
    },
    {
      "actorId": "leon",
      "speaker": "里昂",
      "text": "我没再按第二次付款。订单应该还是待处理，尾号 2406。",
      "profile": "N21",
      "clipId": "n21-9171e5a91fbf",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/n21-9171e5a91fbf.wav",
      "seconds": 5.8097
    },
    {
      "actorId": "leon",
      "speaker": "里昂",
      "text": "没有，只付了一次，尾号 2406，卡也是这张。",
      "profile": "N21",
      "clipId": "n21-1f691ba21cac",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/n21-1f691ba21cac.wav",
      "seconds": 4.6971
    },
    {
      "actorId": "leon",
      "speaker": "里昂",
      "text": "油泵修好了。我带来三年前的报纸原件，复印件上的名字每次都变。收好这张，别交给自称老板的人。",
      "profile": "N21",
      "clipId": "n21-512e8ab7711b",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/n21-512e8ab7711b.wav",
      "seconds": 9.3548
    },
    {
      "actorId": "leon",
      "speaker": "里昂",
      "text": "我留着昨晚2406的凭据。油泵的事已经处理完了，今晚只买这些。",
      "profile": "N21",
      "clipId": "n21-1bcae13cf8b2",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/n21-1bcae13cf8b2.wav",
      "seconds": 6.6123
    },
    {
      "actorId": "leon",
      "speaker": "里昂",
      "text": "原件写的是：第八出口事故，夜班员 Daniel Reed 未归。没有第九出口。",
      "profile": "N21",
      "clipId": "n21-285b7ad11280",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/n21-285b7ad11280.wav",
      "seconds": 6.6367
    },
    {
      "actorId": "leon",
      "speaker": "里昂",
      "text": "我还在挑东西。有什么事吗？",
      "profile": "N21",
      "clipId": "n21-cb6b2b44d375",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/n21-cb6b2b44d375.wav",
      "seconds": 2.6511
    },
    {
      "actorId": "leon",
      "speaker": "里昂",
      "text": "这些就是我挑的商品。麻烦你了。",
